598 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (What it means for you. An owner is rarely the AI Act user of a hotel's tools; the operator or the brand usually is \(see A4, p. 7\). But owners carry the money risk: they approve the spend, sign the management and franchise agreements, and hold the asset whose value a fine, a stopped rollout or a data breach can hit.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
